{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spiritstead</strong> is a cozy life sim town building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will arrive along with new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to gather resources, earn gold, and keep your town running and growing. But be careful, if you overwork them, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your villagers become grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. These places help them rest and feel happy again. Otherwise, they might leave the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you expand your village and unlock new levels, you will gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Some say that if your town is just right, magical \u2728spirits\u2728 may appear to help your village or simply be fun to collect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1757290554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1757290554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757290554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757290554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spiritstead</strong> is a cozy life sim town building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will arrive along with new buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/9a6a189ab5aa32798b2e6d77c0b974a5.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to gather resources, earn gold, and keep your town running and growing. But be careful, if you overwork them, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/48c5c6bfb04817ae2a75999d8f4044fb.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your villagers become grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. These places help them rest and feel happy again. Otherwise, they might leave the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/5ba8d4d1ae1a1fbffb9d329a2489cd54.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you expand your village and unlock new levels, you will gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.poster.avif?t=1757290554\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.webm?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/0f3856cf50116ada0ec85075ab15b31f.mp4?t=1757290554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Some say that if your town is just right, magical \u2728spirits\u2728 may appear to help your village or simply be fun to collect.</p>","developers":["Turbo Dog Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/43e16c71202e899d2ec9233b632904971557ee0d/header.jpg?t=1757290554","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170287,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie480.mp4?t=1756686080","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie_max.mp4?t=1756686080"},"name":"Spiritstead Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170287/d0554a597a6ef4ac27589f144859cda20ebec651/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756686080","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756686080","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170287/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756686080"}}],"name":"Spiritstead","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics should be enough<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Turbo Dog Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"i